sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Estimator as Estimator
    participant UI as Frontend SPA (Browser)
    participant API as FastAPI Backend (main.py)
    participant Cost as Costing Engine (costing.py)
    participant DB as Relational Database
    actor Sales as Sales Head

    Note over Estimator, DB: Phase 1: Costing & Draft Revision Generation
    Estimator->>UI: Selects RFQ and enters cost inputs (Weight, Scrap %, Routing, Margin %)
    UI->>API: PATCH /api/parts/{part_id} (PartPatch + RoutingOperations)
    API->>DB: Update Part and replace RoutingOperation records
    API-->>UI: 200 OK (Updated part details)

    Estimator->>UI: Selects volumes [e.g. 10000, 50000, 180000] and clicks "Calculate Quote"
    UI->>API: POST /api/rfqs/{rfq_id}/cost {volumes: [10000, 50000, 180000]}
    API->>DB: Query Effective Material & Machine Rates (RateVersion)
    DB-->>API: Active rate records
    API->>Cost: calculate_part(...) with Python Decimal
    Cost-->>API: Exact line-item cost scenarios & annual values
    API->>DB: INSERT QuoteRevision (status='draft', breakdown_json, rate_snapshot_json, gst_rate_percent)
    DB-->>API: revision_id
    API->>DB: INSERT AuditEvent (calculate_quote)
    API-->>UI: 200 OK (Calculated breakdown, scenarios, GST amounts)

    Estimator->>UI: Clicks "Submit for Approval"
    UI->>API: POST /api/revisions/{revision_id}/submit
    API->>DB: UPDATE QuoteRevision (status='pending_approval')
    API->>DB: UPDATE RFQ (status='pending_approval')
    API->>DB: INSERT AuditEvent (submit_for_approval)
    API-->>UI: 200 OK (Status updated)

    Note over Sales, DB: Phase 2: Sales Governance & Commercial Approval
    Sales->>UI: Navigates to Approvals view
    UI->>API: GET /api/approvals
    API->>DB: Query revisions WHERE status='pending_approval'
    DB-->>API: Pending quote list
    API-->>UI: 200 OK (Queue items with breakdowns and rate snapshots)

    alt Sales Returns Quote
        Sales->>UI: Enters return feedback and clicks "Return"
        UI->>API: POST /api/revisions/{revision_id}/decision {decision: 'return', reason: 'Re-negotiate raw material rate'}
        API->>DB: INSERT Approval (decision='return', reason)
        API->>DB: UPDATE QuoteRevision (status='returned'), UPDATE RFQ (status='estimating')
        API->>DB: INSERT AuditEvent (quote_return)
        API-->>UI: 200 OK (Quote returned to estimator)
    else Sales Approves Quote
        Sales->>UI: Clicks "Approve Quote"
        UI->>API: POST /api/revisions/{revision_id}/decision {decision: 'approve'}
        API->>DB: Check annual value > ₹25L statutory threshold
        API->>DB: INSERT Approval (decision='approve')
        API->>DB: UPDATE QuoteRevision (status='approved', approved_at=now)
        API->>DB: UPDATE RFQ (status='approved')
        API->>DB: INSERT AuditEvent (quote_approve)
        API-->>UI: 200 OK (Status approved, threshold_flag)

        Sales->>UI: Clicks "Download PDF"
        UI->>API: GET /api/revisions/{revision_id}/pdf
        API->>DB: Fetch QuoteRevision, RFQ, Part details
        API->>API: Build ReportLab Document (Table, GST breakups, Synthetic disclaimers)
        API-->>UI: 200 OK (application/pdf stream)

        Sales->>UI: Dispatches to customer and clicks "Mark Sent"
        UI->>API: POST /api/revisions/{revision_id}/sent
        API->>DB: UPDATE QuoteRevision (status='sent'), UPDATE RFQ (status='sent')
        API-->>UI: 200 OK
    end
